        "classical_preprocessing": "Train-only StandardScaler; train-only Pearson correlation analysis; feature reordering; majority-class downsampling; stratified splitting; class-weighted BCEWithLogitsLoss.",
        "classical_postprocessing": "Thresholding predicted probabilities with default threshold 0.3; classification report and confusion matrix; reporting precision, recall, ROC-AUC, PR-AUC, and CPU time."
